* keyboard
* mouse
* touch/pointer gestures
* controller/gamepad
* local multiplayer controllers

Visual changes must not silently break input handling.

Any DOM restructuring that changes IDs, selectors, event targets, or dynamically generated controls must be reflected safely in the relevant JavaScript.

